## 🧪 Test Strategy

### Testing Approach
**TDD Principle**: We will aim to write tests for core utilities and API endpoints.

### Test Pyramid for This Feature
| Test Type | Coverage Target | Purpose |
|-----------|-----------------|---------|
| **Unit Tests** | ≥80% | Auth services, ValidationDTOs, Utilities |
| **Integration Tests** | Critical paths | Login flow, Sign-up flow, DB connection |
| **E2E Tests** | Key user flows | Full Sign-up -> Login -> Get Profile loop |

### Test File Organization
```
apps/backend/src/
├── auth/
│   ├── auth.service.spec.ts (Unit)
│   └── ...
test/ (Backend E2E)
├── app.e2e-spec.ts
```

---

