## ⚠️ Risk Assessment

| Risk | Probability | Impact | Mitigation Strategy |
|------|-------------|--------|---------------------|
| Authentication security gaps | Low | High | Use standard libraries (Passport, bcrypt), review JWT best practices. |
| Monorepo complexity | Medium | Medium | Keep tooling simple initially (npm/pnpm workspaces). |
| Data Model changes | High | Medium | Use Prisma migrations to evolve schema safely. |

---

## 🔄 Rollback Strategy

### If Phase 2 Fails (DB/Auth)
**Steps to revert**:
- `prisma migrate reset` to clear DB state.
- Revert git commit to Phase 1 tag.

